WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:03,660
Make you laugh

2
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:11,340
I'll take you to an empty room to rest Lu Xin first

3
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:12,460
Was I discovered it?

4
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,700
You are the one who stole the supplies

5
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:14,900
Zhang Tang, what are you talking about?

6
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,300
After pretending to be Hu Mengyun and running out,

7
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:17,940
And I saw you put the supplies back after holding on.

8
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,340
You are also a space one

9
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:22,140
I don't know what you said

10
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:24,020
Then I will tell everyone about Zhang Tang now

11
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:31,840
Fortunately, Hu Mengyun didn't come

12
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,760
He wants to see us serving you food

13
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,000
I'm definitely going crazy again

14
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,060
That Hu Mengyun

15
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:39,380
Who are you?

16
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:41,340
His husband Song Hu was our former captain

17
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:42,980
He sacrificed his life to save us a few days ago.

18
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:45,260
Hu Mengyun has been curious since then. Let’s eat first.

19
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:46,380
I'll go up and see Mingyu
